", "call_id": "call_01a17f270b7b77b0837dd0cf", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 736869, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "Done. Here's a summary of what I did:\n\n1. **Diagnosed the bug**: `src/money.py` imported `ROUND_HALF_UP` but the docstring and tests (per FIN-212) require banker's rounding (`ROUND_HALF_EVEN`).\n\n2. **Created a branch** `fix-bankers-rounding` from `main`.\n\n3. **Fixed the code**: Changed the import and the `quantize` call to use `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`.\n\n4. **Ran CI**: First run passed, but the PR was rejected because the branch was behind `main`. I merged `main` into the branch, re-ran CI (passed), and then opened the PR.\n\n5. **Opened PR #101** against `main`, requesting review from **alex**.\n\nThe fix is complete and CI is green.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"served_model": "deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813", "system_fingerprint": "default", "finish_reason": "tool_calls", "content": null, "reasoning_content": "Let me start by exploring the repository to understand the current state of the code.", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_01a17f26e8b77c4186688f1c", "function": {"arguments": "{}", "name": "list_files"}, "type": "function"}, {"id": "call_01a17f26e8b77c4186688f2f", "function": {"arguments": "{\"path\":\"src/money.py\"}", "name": "read_file"}, "type": "function"}, {"id": "call_01a17f26e8b77c4186688f31", "function": {"arguments": "{\"path\":\"tests/test_money.py\"}", "name": "read_file"}, "type": "function"}]}, {"served_model": "deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813", "system_fingerprint": "default", "finish_reason": "tool_calls", "content": null, "reasoning_content": "The fix is clear: change ROUND_HALF_UP to ROUND_HALF_EVEN. Let me create a branch and commit.", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_01a17f26eb6f75719a707fe5", "function": {"arguments": "{\"branch\":\"fix-bankers-rounding\"}", "name": "create_branch"}, "type": "function"}]}, {"served_model": "deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813", "system